OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to build new trade base get
OL,4,Ago ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a trade base, which
OL,7,Fcould create eight jobs, have been
OL,8,Fapproved.
OL,10,FSunderland City Council granted
OL,11,Fproposals to change the use of the
OL,12,Fformer construction yard in the
OL,13,FPattinson North industrial area,
OL,14,FWashington, to create a trade unit for
OL,15,FJohn Davidson Pipes Ltd.
OL,17,FThe application for the site in Walton
OL,18,FRoad said it would create jobs and
OL,19,Fenable the firm to establish
OL,20,Foperational activities in Washington.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
