OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to build new trade base get
OL,4,Ago ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil officers said the unit raised
OL,7,Fno issues over access for surrounding
OL,8,Foccupants or highway and pedestrian
OL,9,Fsafety, adding the trade counter would
OL,10,F"form a very small part of the
OL,11,Fbusiness".
